sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    actor Lecturer
    participant TakeExamPage
    participant ExamSubmissionsPage
    participant SubmissionServiceFE as SubmissionService
    participant ExamServiceFE as ExamService
    participant ApiService
    participant Gateway
    participant SubmissionsController as "submissions controller"
    participant SubmissionsSubmit as submitExam
    participant SubmissionsGrade as gradeSubmission
    participant ExamsController as "exams controller"
    participant ExamsAvailable as getAvailableExamById
    participant ExamsPublish as publishExamResults
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Student,DB: API mode with JWT via ApiService

    Student->>TakeExamPage: submit answers
    TakeExamPage->>SubmissionServiceFE: submitExam(studentId, examId, selectedAnswers)
    SubmissionServiceFE->>ExamServiceFE: getAvailableExamById(examId)
    ExamServiceFE->>ApiService: get /api/exams/available/:id
    ApiService->>Gateway: GET /api/exams/available/:id
    Gateway->>ExamsController: proxy /api/exams
    ExamsController->>ExamsAvailable: getAvailableExamById(examId)
    ExamsAvailable->>DB: load published exam
    DB-->>ExamsAvailable: exam
    ExamsAvailable-->>ExamsController: exam JSON
    ExamsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: exam JSON
    ApiService-->>ExamServiceFE: exam JSON
    ExamServiceFE-->>SubmissionServiceFE: exam
    SubmissionServiceFE->>ApiService: post /api/submissions
    ApiService->>Gateway: POST /api/submissions
    Gateway->>SubmissionsController: proxy /api/submissions
    SubmissionsController->>SubmissionsSubmit: submitExam(studentId, input)
    SubmissionsSubmit->>DB: INSERT submission
    DB-->>SubmissionsSubmit: submission
    SubmissionsSubmit-->>SubmissionsController: submission JSON
    SubmissionsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: submission JSON
    ApiService-->>SubmissionServiceFE: submission JSON
    SubmissionServiceFE-->>TakeExamPage: submission JSON

    Lecturer->>ExamSubmissionsPage: save grades and feedback
    ExamSubmissionsPage->>SubmissionServiceFE: gradeSubmission(submissionId, questionGrades, feedback)
    SubmissionServiceFE->>ApiService: patch /api/submissions/:id/grade
    ApiService->>Gateway: PATCH /api/submissions/:id/grade
    Gateway->>SubmissionsController: proxy /api/submissions
    SubmissionsController->>SubmissionsGrade: gradeSubmission
    SubmissionsGrade->>DB: UPDATE submission
    DB-->>SubmissionsGrade: updated submission
    SubmissionsGrade-->>SubmissionsController: submission JSON
    SubmissionsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: submission JSON
    ApiService-->>SubmissionServiceFE: submission JSON
    SubmissionServiceFE-->>ExamSubmissionsPage: submission JSON

    Lecturer->>ExamSubmissionsPage: publish results
    ExamSubmissionsPage->>ExamServiceFE: publishResults(examId, teacherId)
    ExamServiceFE->>ApiService: post /api/exams/:id/publish-results
    ApiService->>Gateway: POST /api/exams/:id/publish-results
    Gateway->>ExamsController: proxy /api/exams
    ExamsController->>ExamsPublish: publishExamResults(examId, teacherId)
    ExamsPublish->>DB: UPDATE results_published
    DB-->>ExamsPublish: updated exam
    ExamsPublish-->>ExamsController: exam JSON
    ExamsController-->>Gateway: response
    Gateway-->>ApiService: exam JSON
    ApiService-->>ExamServiceFE: exam JSON
    ExamServiceFE-->>ExamSubmissionsPage: exam JSON
